LEN      NEW              ! Set up LDM for a new lens.
EPD      20               ! Entrance pupil set to 10 mm.
TIT      'OSDmirror'      ! Title the mirror.
RDY      S1 -100          ! Assign R1 = -100. It is negative because the
                          ! center of curvature is to the left.
RMD      S1 REFL          ! Set the surface to reflection.
PIM                       ! Solve for the paraxial image location.
VIE ; GO                  ! Show the mirror.
